ed so effort history is durable across restarts.\r\n- **Ignored (C10):** raw job logs, large generated artifacts (PDF), and any\r\n  `raw/` payloads that could carry absolute paths, tokens, or personal data.\r\n  The distribution build (Wave 8) additionally scans for and refuses to ship\r\n  anything under `.anchor/`.\r\n\r\nSee the sibling `.gitignore` for the exact rules.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c0b87c73-d19e-4bb1-81e5-6660ec9ab2a9","uuid":"1b5a17c1-cc77-4acb-bc6e-876ccf5ed825","timestamp":"2026-06-14T02:28:18.612Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":".anchor/.gitignore\n.anchor/projects/fe0a3e82a76347a19c91c365fd87787c/build/efforts/disc-18333cf3c1eaff05.pointer.json\n.anchor/projects/fe0a3e82a76347a19c91c365fd87787c/build/efforts/disc-d1e4247db24ad8f0.pointer.json\n.anchor/projects/fe0a3e82a76347a19c91c365fd87787c/build/index.json\n.anchor/projects/fe0a3e82a76347a19c91c365fd87787c/discovery.json\n.anchor/projects/fe0a3e82a76347a19c91c365fd87787c/grass/efforts/disc-6711b10ad423ff72.pointer.json\n.anchor/projects/fe0a3e82a76347a19c91c365fd87787c/grass/efforts/disc-97c5ea8603ffebac.pointer.json\n.anchor/projects/fe0a3e82a76347a19c91c365fd87787c/grass/index.json\n.anchor/projects/fe0a3e82a76347a19c91c365fd87787c/planning/efforts/disc-4f7680b7a2021b6f.pointer.json\n.anchor/projects/fe0a3e82a76347a19c91c365fd87787c/planning/efforts/disc-5caf8280ff06df8b.pointer.json\n.anchor/projects/fe0a3e82a76347a19c91c365fd87787c/planning/efforts/disc-955a985071bf3ae4.pointer.json\n.anchor/projects/fe0a3e82a76347a19c91c365fd87787c/planning/efforts/disc-b90bef1fe0485809.pointer.json\n.anchor/projects/fe0a3e82a76347a19c91c365fd87787c/planning/index.json\n.anchor/projects/fe0a3e82a76347a19c91c365fd87787c/project-summary.json\n.anchor/projects/fe0a3e82a76347a19c91c365fd87787c/project-summary.md\n.anchor/README\n===README===\n# .anchor/ â€” Anchor R&D per-project store\r\n\r\nThis directory is created and managed by Anchor's R&D control surface. Each\r\nreg